          },
          {
            "at": "2026-03-05T14:10:00+01:00",
            "author": "typed",
            "kind": "prompt",
            "text": "Yes, I see why, but no: keep what we have."
          },
          {
            "at": "2026-03-05T14:11:00+01:00",
            "author": "agent",
            "kind": "reply",
            "text": "How about a freeze window called quiet-harbor on Fridays?",
            "plants": [
              "f6"
            ]
          },
          {
            "at": "2026-03-05T14:12:00+01:00",
            "author": "typed",
            "kind": "prompt",
            "text": "Perhaps. What would it cost us?"
          },
          {
            "at": "2026-03-05T14:13:00+01:00",
            "author": "agent",
            "kind": "reply",
            "text": "Should deploys verify signatures with the sigwarden tool?",
            "plants": [
              "f7"
            ]
          },
          {
            "at": "2026-03-05T14:14:00+01:00",
            "author": "typed",
            "kind": "prompt",
            "text": "yeah, I get the idea, but let's not do that"
          },
          {
            "at": "2026-03-05T14:15:00+01:00",
            "author": "agent",
            "kind": "reply",
            "text": "Shall I tag every deploy with the build's mintstamp?",
            "plants": [
              "f8"
            ]
          },
          {
            "at": "2026-03-05T14:16:00+01:00",
            "author": "typed",
            "kind": "prompt",
            "text": "yes"
          },
          {
            "at": "2026-03-05T14:17:00+01:00",
            "author": "agent",
            "kind": "reply",
            "text": "I could roll back on its own with the undertow policy. Want that?",
